            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-f104344a5193cf6cee7ee29d"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "enhanced_pretraining",
        "text": "作者通过在BERT预训练中引入semantic-enhanced任务（包含previous sentence prediction和document level prediction）来优化BERT，并将MLM、NSP与该任务结合进行预训练。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-c36b758941a50635b2471a56"
          },
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-77b182970420dff76e4cd9a1"
          },
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-f104344a5193cf6cee7ee29d"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "three_technologies",
        "text": "论文将enhanced BERT pre-training、soft label embedding和NER pre-training列为进一步提升性能的三项主要技术。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-0f3bf35195202e464e2739cc"
          },
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "ner_pretrain_corpus",
        "text": "作者引入大规模百度百科语料用于entity recognition预训练，由于没有实际命名实体标签，该预训练属于weakly supervised learning。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "soft_label_embedding",
        "text": "论文提出soft label embedding，用于在entity recognition与relation extraction之间有效传递信息。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "multi_sigmoid_relation",
        "text": "关系分类被建模为multi-head selection问题；由于同一实体对可有多个关系，关系预测采用multi-sigmoid层，训练时最小化交叉熵损失L_rel。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-3fd51d54d4cee4f5bef3a97a"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "single_model_f1",
        "text": "结合上述三项改进后，单模型在testset-1上取得F1-score 0.876。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "paper_id": "1908.05908",
            "chunk_id": "c-59affd016a6cbaeed876468f"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "key": "ensemble_f1",
        "text": "对四个模型变体进行ensemble后，最终在testset-1上取得F1 0.892（第1名），在testset-2上取得F1 0.8924（第2名）。",
        "citations": [
